      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 600,
      "text": "Do not argue on behalf of those who betray themselves, for Allah does not like the treacherous and sinful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 4,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النِّسَاءِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nisaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Women",
        "numberOfAyahs": 176,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 107,
      "juz": 5,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 96,
      "ruku": 77,
      "hizbQuarter": 38,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 601,
      "text": "They seek to hide from people but they do not seek to hide from Allah, although He is with them when they devise plans to say things that are displeasing to Him[77]. Indeed, Allah encompasses all what they do.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 4,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النِّسَاءِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nisaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Women",
        "numberOfAyahs": 176,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 108,
      "juz": 5,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 96,
      "ruku": 77,
      "hizbQuarter": 38,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 602,
      "text": "Here you are, you are those who argue on their behalf in the life of this world[78], but who will argue on their behalf before Allah on the Day of Resurrection, or who will be their defender?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 4,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النِّسَاءِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nisaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Women",
        "numberOfAyahs": 176,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 109,
      "juz": 5,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 96,
      "ruku": 77,
      "hizbQuarter": 38,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 603,
      "text": "Whoever commits evil or wrongs himself, then seeks Allah’s forgiveness will find Allah All-Forgiving, Most Merciful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 4,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النِّسَاءِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nisaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Women",
        "numberOfAyahs": 176,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 110,
      "juz": 5,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 96,
      "ruku": 77,
      "hizbQuarter": 38,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 604,
      "text": "And whoever commits a sin, only commits it against himself. And Allah is All-Knowing, All-Wise.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 4,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النِّسَاءِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nisaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Women",
        "numberOfAyahs": 176,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 111,
      "juz": 5,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 96,
      "ruku": 77,
      "hizbQuarter": 38,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 605,
      "text": "But whoever commits an offense or a sin, then blames it on an innocent person, will surely bear the guilt of slander and flagrant sin[79].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 4,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النِّسَاءِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nisaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Women",
        "numberOfAyahs": 176,
        "revelationType": "Medinan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 112,
      "juz": 5,
      "manzil": 1,
      "page": 96,
      "ruku": 77,
      "hizbQuarter": 38,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 606,
      "text": "Were it not for Allah’s grace and mercy upon you [O Prophet], a group of them would have tried to mislead you, but they only mislead themselves, nor can they harm you in the least. For Allah has sent down to you the Book and Wisdom[80] and has taught you what you did not know. And the grace of Allah upon you is always great.",
      "surah": {
